<apex:component controller="ThankyouEmail_InspecEmailController" access="global">
    
    <apex:attribute name="projectId" description="Project Record Id" assignTo="{!targetId}" type="String" />
    <apex:attribute name="contactId" description="Recipient Contact Id" assignTo="{!targetContactId}" type="String" />
    
    <style>
        .email-text { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333; line-height: 1.5; }
        .bold-text { font-weight: bold; }
        p { margin-bottom: 15px; }
        a { color: #0000EE; text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>

    <apex:image url="{!SterisBannerURL}" alt="STERIS Banner" />
    <br/>

    <div class="email-text">
        
        <p>Hello {!recipientRec.Name},</p>

        <p>
            At STERIS, we strive to make a difference for our Customers and their patients. 
            In keeping with that goal, we feel it is important for us to follow-up on the recent 
            installation at your facility to ensure that the equipment is operating to your expectations.
        </p>

        <p>
            If you have any equipment related issues whatsoever please call our service center at 
            <span class="bold-text">1-800-333-8828</span> and a technician will be dispatched to your 
            facility as soon as is possible.
        </p>

        <p>
            STERIS’s top priority is providing our Customers with consistent and memorable World Class Service. 
            If you feel that there was anything we could have done better, we ask that you please let us know.
        </p>

        <p>
            Please feel free to reply or contact me, and/or my Manager, 
            <span class="bold-text">{!currentUser.Manager.Name}</span>, 
            via email <a href="mailto:{!currentUser.Manager.Email}">{!currentUser.Manager.Email}</a>, 
            or phone {!currentUser.Manager.Phone}, who is copied on this message, with any suggestions or feedback.
        </p>

        <p>
            In the near future you will be receiving a phone call from our survey department. 
            They will be asking for your feedback on your installation experience. I sincerely hope that 
            you can find the time to take this short survey. I am also hopeful that you will be able to 
            report that your installation experience was what you would expect from a World Class Service Organization.
        </p>

        <p>
            Again, I would like to express my appreciation for using STERIS Installation Services and 
            look forward to working with you in the future.
        </p>

        <p>Best Regards,</p>

        <p>
            {!currentUser.FirstName} {!currentUser.LastName}<br/>
            {!currentUser.Title}<br/>
            {!currentUser.CompanyName}<br/>
            {!currentUser.Phone}
        </p>
    </div>

</apex:component>